
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ro">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>ShadowCosmic | Server Discord</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Intră în comunitatea ShadowCosmic pe Discord!">
  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #101020, #292052);
      color: white;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      text-align: center;
    }
    main { padding: 24px; }
    h1 { font-size: 38px; }
    p { color: #d0cce8; }
    a {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 18px;
      padding: 15px 25px;
      background: #5865f2;
      color: white;
      border-radius: 10px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: bold;
    }
    a:hover { background: #4752c4; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main>
    <h1>🌌 ShadowCosmic</h1>
    <p>Alătură-te comunității noastre!</p>
    <a href="https://discord.gg/vccdtsRJ39"
       target="_blank" rel="noopener">
      INTRĂ PE DISCORD 🚀
    </a>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
  
